                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Instrumentation.AWS-1.14.1"&gt;Instrumentation.AWS-1.14.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Extensions.AWS/1.14.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Extensions.AWS v1.14.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No notable changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.AWS-1.14.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Extensions.AWS/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWS/1.14.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWS v1.14.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No notable changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.AWS-1.14.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWS/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWSLambda/1.14.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWSLambda v1.14.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix issue when using ADOT auto-instrumentation which includes a version of&lt;br&gt;
OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWSLambda in the Lambda layer. In this scenario&lt;br&gt;
nothing is forcing the NuGet resolution to include the updated version of&lt;br&gt;
Amazon.Lambda.Core that has the &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3410" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3410/hovercard"&gt;reworked logic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
for determining the trace id.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3629" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/3629/hovercard"&gt;#3629&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.AWS-1.14.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AWSLambda/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
